! PhotonBoard - USITT ASCII export
! Show: Club Night
IDENT 3:0
MANUFACTURER PhotonBoard
CONSOLE PhotonBoard
CLEAR ALL
SET CHANNELS 601
SET DIMMERS 271

! Patch: channel = fixture number, dimmer = DMX address of its intensity
! channel, (universe-1)*512 + address
PATCH 1 101<5@FL 102<18@FL 103<31@FL 104<44@FL 201<65@FL 202<76@FL 203<87@FL
PATCH 1 204<98@FL 301<125@FL 302<133@FL 303<141@FL 304<149@FL 305<157@FL
PATCH 1 306<165@FL 307<173@FL 308<181@FL 401<201@FL 402<227@FL 501<261@FL
PATCH 1 502<263@FL 601<271@FL

! Cue list 1: Warm Wash
CUE 1
  TEXT Amber
  UP 3
  DOWN 2
  CHAN 301/HE6 302/HE6 303/HE6 304/HE6 305/HE6 306/HE6 307/HE6 308/HE6


! Cue list 2: Cool Blue (extension $SEQUENCE / $CUE)
$SEQUENCE 2 0 Cool Blue
$CUE 2 1
  TEXT Blue
  UP 4
  DOWN 2
  CHAN 201/HFF 202/HFF 203/HFF 204/HFF 301/HDC 302/HDC 303/HDC 304/HDC 305/HDC
  CHAN 306/HDC 307/HDC 308/HDC


