  CHAN 402/HFF


! Cue list 9: Haze 40% (extension $SEQUENCE / $CUE)
$SEQUENCE 9 0 Haze 40%
$CUE 9 1
  TEXT Haze
  UP 5
  DOWN 2
  CHAN 601/H64


! Cue list 10: Club Intro (extension $SEQUENCE / $CUE)
$SEQUENCE 10 0 Club Intro
$CUE 10 1
  TEXT Haze & dark
  UP 1
  DOWN 2
  FOLLOWON 6
  CHAN 601/H78

$CUE 10 2
  TEXT Back light
  UP 6
  DOWN 2
