  UP 5
  DOWN 2
  CHAN 201/HFF 202/HFF 203/HFF 204/HFF 301/HC8 302/HC8 303/HC8 304/HC8 305/HC8
  CHAN 306/HC8 307/HC8 308/HC8 601/H78


! Cue list 11: Drop (extension $SEQUENCE / $CUE)
$SEQUENCE 11 0 Drop
